  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Navigation"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "How can a user navigate a document effectively?"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- To effectively navigate a document, a user should make use of two key features:\n\n  - **Bookmarks**\n  - **Hyperlinks**"
  },
  {
   "type": "figure",
   "orig_src": "https://cdn.savemyexams.com/uploads/2024/06/18402_navigation-hyperlinksandbookmarks-ezgif-com-video-to-webp-converter.webp",
   "file": "assets/3e290add2b4e-18402-navigation-hyperlinksandbookmarks-ezgif-co.webp",
   "alt": "Adding bookmarks and hyperlinks",
   "caption": ""
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Bookmarks"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- A bookmark in a document works similarly to a bookmark in the real world, it allows the user to **mark a place in a document** that they wish to be able to easily find and navigate to again\n- To create a bookmark:\n\n  - **Highlight the text you wish to bookmark then click 'Insert bookmark'**\n- To delete a bookmark:\n\n  - **Click the bookmarks buttons and then select 'Delete'**"
  },
  {
   "type": "figure",
   "orig_src": "https://cdn.savemyexams.com/uploads/2024/06/45279_delete-bookmark.webp",
   "file": "assets/9faa2c718988-45279-delete-bookmark.webp",
   "alt": "Removing a bookmark",
   "caption": ""
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Hyperlinks"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- A hyperlink is a **clickable link** that can **navigate to another place **in a document or to an external webpage or external file\n- To create a hyperlink:\n\n  - **Highlight the text you wish to link, click 'Insert\" then \"Link'**\n- To delete a hyperlink:\n\n  - **Highlight the text you wish to link, click 'Insert\" then \"Link' then 'Remove Link'**"
  },
  {
   "type": "figure",
   "orig_src": "https://cdn.savemyexams.com/uploads/2024/06/25882_remove-a-hyperlink.webp",
   "file": "assets/a77b888e25be-25882-remove-a-hyperlink.webp",
   "alt": "Removing a hyperlink",
   "caption": ""
  }
 ]
